<p>I took the day off work and took my e-mountain bike for a pedal. The new part was carrying on past Barmolloch and doing a wee loop of Ford.</p>

<p>The route goes through Kilmichael Glen which I think is one of the most beautiful parts of the area.</p>

<figure><img src="./images/Barmolloch.jpg" alt="A road curves around a small hill as it winds through farming landscape.">
<figcaption>The road from Barmolloch towards Ford</figcaption>
</figure>

<p>It's interesting to see just how many estates are scattered across the local area. Land ownership remains a real problem in Scotland.</p>